msgid "Link your YouTube account to browse subscriptions, Watch Later, playlists and history."
msgstr "Link your YouTube account to browse subscriptions, Watch Later, playlists and history."

msgctxt "#32057"
msgid "Removes the linked YouTube account and its local snapshot."
msgstr "Removes the linked YouTube account and its local snapshot."

